error[SCXML015]: send with `content` cannot also use `namelist`
 --> tests/ui/scxml015-send-content-and-namelist.scx:4:26
  |
4 |       <send event="ping" namelist="x">
  |                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^ namelist conflicts with content
5 |         <content>payload</content>
  |          ------- content declared here
  |
  = note: `<content>` supplies the complete payload; `namelist` and `<param>` build a key/value payload, so the two forms cannot be combined
  = help: use `content` or `namelist`, not both
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>

